    "method": "The assay was used according to manufacturer instructions. There was no signal in either regular serum or ethanol-extracted serum samples at any of the tested dilutions. The spike recovery was good (~108.67%), suggesting that matrix interference is unlikely to be the main problem. It appears likely that the assay lacks cross-reactivity with equine adiponectin."
